# CODEOWNERS — structural review routing
#
# Coverage statement: every workspace crate and the docs, contracts, CI,
# scripts, tests and packaging surfaces have an explicit owner pattern.
#
# This file provides *structural* coverage, not a per-area ownership
# assignment. The repository has no recorded area owners yet. The handles
# below are the current repository collaborators with write access; they are
# listed so review routing is valid today. Replace them with named area
# owners or teams as part of issue #50's follow-up.
#
# Note: `@o3kio` is the owning GitHub *organization*, not a user or team.
# GitHub CODEOWNERS requires a user or team handle, so the organization
# cannot be listed as a code owner by itself.
#
# Last matching pattern wins.

# Default: anything not matched below.
